    {
      "id": "seg:code:declaration:0006:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nfunc insertTimeRange(_ timeRange: CMTimeRange, of asset: AVAsset, at startTime: CMTime, completionHandler: @escaping @Sendable ((any Error)?) -> Void)\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nfunc insertTimeRange(_ timeRange: CMTimeRange, of asset: AVAsset, at startTime: CMTime, completionHandler: @escaping @Sendable ((any Error)?) -> Void)\n```",
      "sourceHash": "cb99596d6e5b2343656219e8adebbafdf809a3c3a1c569c3d9dcfd576d01f0a9",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:discussion:0007:0001",
      "source": "Discussion",
      "ko": "Discussion",
      "sourceHash": "5eb6cf647d2c5d14a044e2d103dcef4cf0cdc872434c374debc1043092bc4746",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "If necessary, a composition adds new tracks to ensure that it inserts all tracks in the source asset for the time range.",
      "ko": "필요한 경우 composition은 소스 자산의 시간 범위에서 모든 트랙을 삽입하기 위해 새 트랙을 추가합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7149d28ea4c86e665d5fcf4cc38d3764643bcc8ea62896a67c3274ceb3adc39d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Inserting a time range pushes out existing content at the specified start time by the time range’s duration.",
      "ko": "Format description can have extensions of type [`kCMFormatDescriptionExtension_VerbatimSampleDescription`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/kCMFormatDescriptionExtension_VerbatimSampleDescription) and [`kCMFormatDescriptionExtension_VerbatimISOSampleEntry`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/kCMFormatDescriptionExtension_VerbatimISOSampleEntry).",
      "sourceHash": "b32fea934c6be784fe27748ba147f9332231d4adbb35de648878a4e37a5cac5f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "The composition presents the media data for the inserted time range at its natural duration and rate.",
      "ko": "구성은 삽입된 시간 범위의 미디어 데이터를 원래 길이와 재생률로 표시합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b6cac860a9841941934ea6ba0507dd07a2e83a66e81e03dbbaed5a3031cdd4a2",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "You can scale it to a different duration, which changes the presentation rate, by calling [`scaleTimeRange(_:toDuration:)`](avmutablecomposition/scaletimerange(_:toduration:).md).",
      "ko": "[`scaleTimeRange(_:toDuration:)`](avmutablecomposition/scaletimerange(_:toduration:).md)를 호출하면 표시률이 변경되도록 이를 다른 길이로 스케일링할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "970bd84463b7134d7639350ef9e5d377d33253b28a4db0e1167ef38551db6300",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:parameters:0010:0001",
      "source": "Parameters",
      "ko": "Parameters",
      "sourceHash": "e68b36b17cbd990802f57741cb75cf3a73fa66a61999b0cd70e3cf7d26cfb25f",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0011:0001",
      "source": "`timeRange`: The time range of the asset’s tracks to insert into the composition.",
      "ko": "`timeRange`: composition에 삽입할 자산 트랙의 시간 범위입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "86f3e13d3ce4f908b3f7f5431ca91e2e4fce750d604bef5a7550b9a61a7d767a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0011:0002",
      "source": "`asset`: The source asset that contains the tracks to insert.",
      "ko": "`asset`: 삽입할 트랙을 포함하는 소스 자산입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "aa59d3d1e283a6b48ad2a822d8993d240333bd75bd4c48c76e6bfbc2d7f8328c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0011:0003",
      "source": "`startTime`: A time in the composition to present the inserted tracks.",
      "ko": "`startTime`: 삽입된 트랙을 구성에서 표시할 시간입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "721dd0e6ae31fdd0c90d54f08a1f9286972c5245db60a157517c43924b1ec156",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0011:0004",
      "source": "`completionHandler`: A callback the system invokes when the insertion is complete. If an error occurs, the system passes the callback an error object that describes the failure.",
      "ko": "`completionHandler`: 삽입이 완료되면 시스템이 호출하는 콜백입니다. 오류가 발생하면 시스템은 실패 내용을 설명하는 오류 객체를 콜백에 전달합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "487ed1fb415b3bd59866975afab1cfcba49a7241b5dffec01bcfa6f240d8af3b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
