      "ko": "[func insertEmptyTimeRange(CMTimeRange)](avmutablecomposition/insertemptytimerange(_:).md)",
      "sourceHash": "9a71f71e3c6a47977f6cdb70381e99c13855decb535d2815fad18d4db3b0e860",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:see-also:0018:0001",
      "source": "Adds or extends an empty time range within all tracks of the composition.",
      "ko": "구성의 모든 트랙 내에서 빈 시간 범위를 추가하거나 확장합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "6408aa24d39d69530615260cef30e7c5a530641da5afbf19c7f9e7577d2a4755",
